      "review_date_formatted": "",
      "overall_rating": 0,
      "review_title": "",
      "review_description": "We chose Dollar Solar due to their very cheap pricing and well reviewed products. We are assured by the sales person that the installation would be done by professional  CEC accredited installers. This was not the case. From start to finish, the installation was a nightmare. They didn't have the right materials for our roof type and had to leave delaying the job a day. I took another day off work and waited for 3 hours the next morning after they were meant to arrive. No phone call or text to say they were running late. I called Dollar Solar to ask when they would be arriving but was unable to get any information. I was told I needed to call them but I had no contact details. Very frustrating! When the installation was finally complete, I needed to clean up after them all the wrappers and garbage had been stuffed into my bin but would not fit and blew all over the garden. Also, their ladders scratched my guttering. I have contacted to claim but have not had a reply. Very unprofessional. Cheap price, cheap job.",
